## Why This Is Asked
Evaluates ability to plan and execute breaking API changes with multiple consumers, embedding testing, contract governance, and rollout discipline.

## Key Concepts
- Consumer-driven contracts
- Versioned API lifecycle (v1/v2)
- Canary releases and feature flags
- Deprecation policy and uptime SLAs

